  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mix meat with the rest of the meatball ingredients. Shape into small meatballs. Fry minced onion and garlic in oil in a large pot. Add tomato and beef stock. Heat to boiling. Drop meatballs into boiling broth. Cover tightly and cook for 30 minutes. Add a sprig of cilantro about 10 minutes before soup is done."
